  "instructions": {
    "zh": "按每句话描述你通常情形的准确程度，选择1非常不准确至5非常准确；无法判断或不愿回答可选暂不作答，不补成零或中间值。英文10条来自IPIP公有领域乐观量表，中文为本站试译；4条正向按原回答，6条反向按6减有效回答。10条全部有效才显示原始总分10—50与均分1—5；有任何暂不作答就保留资料不足。题目原本包含对未来、心情与自我感受的不同表述，不将其拆成未经核实的分量表，也不凭答案组合鉴定是否认真。五份完整读法是本站阅读约定，总分18、26、34、42同时呈现相邻两份；不是IPIP官方类型、常模、百分位、健康或职业结论。",
    "en": "Rate how accurately each statement describes you generally, from 1 Very Inaccurate to 5 Very Accurate. Choose the unscored response when you cannot judge or prefer not to answer, without zero or midpoint substitution. Ten English items come from public-domain IPIP Optimism; Chinese is a website trial translation. Four positive items use the response and six negative items use six minus a valid response. All ten ratings are required for a raw total from 10 to 50 and a mean from 1 to 5; any unscored item retains insufficient information. Source items include outlook, mood and self-regard wording, without invented subscales or an attention verdict from response patterns. Five full guides are website reading conventions, with both adjacent guides at totals 18, 26, 34 and 42. They are no official IPIP types, norms, percentiles, health or career verdicts."
  },
